  "title": "Cookie Policy & Settings | Fyntix",
  "description": "Understand Fyntix’s necessary preference cookie and optional Vimeo media. Review, save or withdraw your external-media choice in Cookie settings.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
